{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"intent exclude"},{"type":"text","value":" manages "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"package.json#intent.exclude"},{"type":"text","value":" entries."}]},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-manager","mode":"local-install"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"\":[[\"@tanstack/intent@latest\",\"exclude\",\"[list|add|remove]\",\"[pattern]\",\"[--json]\"]]},\"mode\":\"local-install\"}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--json"},{"type":"text","value":": print the configured exclude patterns as JSON"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"actions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Actions"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"list"},{"type":"text","value":" (default): print current excludes"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"add <pattern>"},{"type":"text","value":": append one exclude pattern"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"remove <pattern>"},{"type":"text","value":": remove one exclude pattern"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-manager","mode":"local-install"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"\":[[\"@tanstack/intent@latest\",\"exclude\"],[\"@tanstack/intent@latest\",\"exclude\",\"list\",\"--json\"],[\"@tanstack/intent@latest\",\"exclude\",\"add\",\"@tanstack/router#experimental-*\"],[\"@tanstack/intent@latest\",\"exclude\",\"remove\",\"@tanstack/router#experimental-*\"]]},\"mode\":\"local-install\"}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"behavior","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Behavior"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Reads and writes the current working directory "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"package.json"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"intent.exclude"},{"type":"text","value":" when missing"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Keeps existing excludes and appends new patterns in order"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Validates pattern syntax before writing"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Refuses invalid "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"package.json"},{"type":"text","value":" structures for "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"intent"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"intent.exclude"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"related","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Related"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../concepts/configuration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuration"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./intent-list","children":[{"type":"text","value":"intent list"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./intent-load","children":[{"type":"text","value":"intent load"}]}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"options","text":"Options","level":2},{"id":"actions","text":"Actions","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"behavior","text":"Behavior","level":2},{"id":"related","text":"Related","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n`intent exclude` manages `package.json#intent.exclude` entries.\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"local-install\" -->\n\n@tanstack/intent@latest exclude [list|add|remove] [pattern] [--json]\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Options\n\n- `--json`: print the configured exclude patterns as JSON\n\n## Actions\n\n1. `list` (default): print current excludes\n2. `add <pattern>`: append one exclude pattern\n3. `remove <pattern>`: remove one exclude pattern\n\n## Examples\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"local-install\" -->\n\n```text\n@tanstack/intent@latest exclude\n@tanstack/intent@latest exclude list --json\n@tanstack/intent@latest exclude add @tanstack/router#experimental-*\n@tanstack/intent@latest exclude remove @tanstack/router#experimental-*\n```\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Reads and writes the current working directory `package.json`\n- Creates `intent.exclude` when missing\n- Keeps existing excludes and appends new patterns in order\n- Validates pattern syntax before writing\n- Refuses invalid `package.json` structures for `intent` and `intent.exclude`\n\n## Related\n\n- [Configuration](../concepts/configuration)\n- [intent list](./intent-list)\n- [intent load](./intent-load)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: intent exclude\nid: intent-exclude\n---\n\n`intent exclude` manages `package.json#intent.exclude` entries.\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"local-install\" -->\n\n@tanstack/intent@latest exclude [list|add|remove] [pattern] [--json]\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Options\n\n- `--json`: print the configured exclude patterns as JSON\n\n## Actions\n\n1. `list` (default): print current excludes\n2. `add <pattern>`: append one exclude pattern\n3. `remove <pattern>`: remove one exclude pattern\n\n## Examples\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"local-install\" -->\n\n```text\n@tanstack/intent@latest exclude\n@tanstack/intent@latest exclude list --json\n@tanstack/intent@latest exclude add @tanstack/router#experimental-*\n@tanstack/intent@latest exclude remove @tanstack/router#experimental-*\n```\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Reads and writes the current working directory `package.json`\n- Creates `intent.exclude` when missing\n- Keeps existing excludes and appends new patterns in order\n- Validates pattern syntax before writing\n- Refuses invalid `package.json` structures for `intent` and `intent.exclude`\n\n## Related\n\n- [Configuration](../concepts/configuration)\n- [intent list](./intent-list)\n- [intent load](./intent-load)\n"}
